; lake_icefall.room - Queda Gelada: a one-way drop from lake_glacier into threshold_bridge's ravine (WORLD-35,
; design 04 section 3.5; "a one-way icefall drop into the Threshold ravine, one room from the wayshrine bench", user,
; 2026-10-14; "Straight drop into deep snow (Recommended)": "One long drop down the shaft that lands in a drift of deep
; snow at the bottom, which breaks the fall: no stun, about 2 s.", user, 2026-10-15). In from the west at rows 5-8 onto
; the floor cell at col 0, then one straight shaft (cols 1-2) on through threshold_icefall_foot onto the deep snow on
; threshold_bridge's fallen span: about 1890 px, 2.4 s, a soft landing (SoftLanding `n` there).
; Nothing in it is standable but the mouth, so it is one-way for every kit without wall climb; wall climb climbs back
; (orchestrator call, 2026-10-14; gotchas/a-one-screen-shaft-cannot-shut-out-wall-climb). Its bottom (y -384) lies
; 544 px over threshold_bridge's highest floor, past a double jump plus a Redoma shell (462 px).
; [back] stone hides the cut against lake_glacier (col 0, rows 4-9).

[room]
origin = 0, 0
tileset = frozen_lake

